      "body": "Since `generateStaticParams` runs in the background, when accessing the `devFallbackParams` during the render, it is still set to the previous result from the cache. Therefore, when the result has changed, re-render the RSC to sync the `devFallbackParams` with the new result.\r\n\r\nCloses NAR-491"
